{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfQeGzyjTG3XWfHTkABZ2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I implemented item #217 (reconciler R2 — `attavo drive` as a pass) on branch `attavo/217-drive-pass` and committed the work.\n\n**What changed:**\n- `attavo/drive.py` — rewritten around a fast pass/worker model: `push_lease` (no-merge, no-retry marker push with race/refusal classification), heartbeat-first `read_invocation`, `fast_forward_to_origin` (skipped while a worker holds the copy), `_start_stage`/`cmd_worker`/`_stage_body` (detached worker with its own heartbeat thread), `_recover_one` (single-invocation recovery), `_advance_again`, `_until_ready`, `_drive_all`, and a rewritten `cmd_drive` dispatcher (`--again`, `--all`, `--report`, `--recover` now exits 2).\n- `attavo/verify.py` — reads `ATTAVO_FORGE_CHECKS` when set instead of polling.\n- `attavo/report.py` — heartbeat-first invocation reads, the stall-bound refusal removed, and a new \"uncommitted record\" reading.\n- `attavo/cli.py` — updated usage/help text and a new `worker` subcommand.\n- Tests: copied the spec's reference `tests/test_pass.py` and `tests/test_drive.py` in full; updated `tests/test_report.py`, `tests/test_stub_ratio.py`, `tests/test_proof_five_elsewhere.py` (retired the two `_drive_step`-based tests, kept the doctor/proof-five ones), `tests/test_record_schemas.py` (json.loads count), `tests/test_cli_help.py`.\n\n**Verified:**\n- `python3 -m mypy` — clean, no issues, no `type: ignore`.\n- All 4 spec criteria scripts pass.\n- `tests/test_pass.py` (9/9) and `tests/test_drive.py` (all) pass; the-tests-exist.sh confirms all 19 named tests exist.\n- Ran `attavo test 217` twice: 116/117 passed both times; the sole failure (`test_attavo_test_ends_a_run_past_its_bound_with_everything_it_started`) is a pre-existing sandbox limitation (`ps` is denied here), unrelated to this change."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":195,"cache_read_input_tokens":333799,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":195},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"041a92ee-b14a-4832-b613-6f5a12b6a373","uuid":"48962490-4bec-4d39-bd81-71bd49fd1f9d","timestamp":"2026-09-25T18:38:04.094Z","request_id":"req_011CfQeGzWTDuU3ZprgYdeLe"}
